From 42b2fb5100c588d35cf0563dd1f33ea2af700003 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Parcel Play OS <kernel@parcel.invalid>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 00:02:00 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] selftests: add Parcel translation smoke tests

Add a correctness test for the sendfile path and a non-destructive capability
inventory used by the FreeBSD-to-Linux comparison.  Performance is deliberately
not a pass/fail condition.

Signed-off-by: Parcel Play OS <kernel@parcel.invalid>
---
